{"text":"And I thought it was perfect, but then, of course, I was crippled by the fear of talking about my fear. I tried to find other people's examples that illustrate the things I've learned about dealing with fear, but I couldn't remember any of them well enough to borrow them. I thought I would hire someone to write my speech, but then they'd know everything about me, including my neurosis. And then I thought I should find another subject to talk about. But then I realized I was doing that actor thing of trying to hide behind something. That's what we do as actors. We tell the truth by pretending to be someone else. So I finally managed to quell my fear and put aside my actor in order to tell you how I got to be an actor in the first place. I would like to dedicate this speech to my sister, who at this time is struggling with finding her purpose. I have three sisters, so I hope I haven't called anyone out.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"I","start":0.58,"end":1.18},{"text":"thought","start":1.18,"end":1.34},{"text":"it","start":1.34,"end":1.46},{"text":"was","start":1.46,"end":1.62},{"text":"perfect","start":1.62,"end":2.02,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":2.38,"end":2.46},{"text":"then","start":2.46,"end":2.64,"punct":","},{"text":"of","start":2.7,"end":2.8},{"text":"course","start":2.8,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":3.42,"end":3.7},{"text":"was","start":3.7,"end":3.82},{"text":"crippled","start":3.82,"end":4.06},{"text":"by","start":4.06,"end":4.34},{"text":"the","start":4.34,"end":4.46},{"text":"fear","start":4.46,"end":4.72},{"text":"of","start":4.72,"end":4.96},{"text":"talking","start":4.96,"end":5.2},{"text":"about","start":5.2,"end":5.4},{"text":"my","start":5.4,"end":5.54},{"text":"fear","start":5.54,"end":5.76,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":7.84,"end":8.36},{"text":"tried","start":8.36,"end":8.76},{"text":"to","start":8.76,"end":8.98},{"text":"find","start":8.98,"end":9.38},{"text":"other","start":9.38,"end":9.